e SQL (YSQL)"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"kai-franz","id":6645568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6645568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz","html_url":"https://github.com/kai-franz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"kai-franz","id":6645568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6645568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz","html_url":"https://github.com/kai-franz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kai-franz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-11-25T19:04:36Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T19:05:07Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-19288](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-19288)\r\n### Description\n\nAfter a catcache is preloaded, we set `yb_cc_is_fully_loaded=true` for that cache. Whenever a lookup gets a miss on a cache with `yb_cc_is_fully_loaded=true`, we treat it like a negative entry (when negative caching is enabled). \n\nWhen `ysql_minimal_catalog_caches_preload` is enabled, we preload catcaches with only the rows corresponding to system entities.\n\nHowever, even with `ysql_minimal_catalog_caches_preload`, we still set `yb_cc_is_fully_loaded=true`, meaning that the cache is now partially filled with only system entries, and we assume that all the remaining rows do not exist.\n\nThis leads to the system thinking that user objects do not exist. Example repro:\n\nStart a cluster with `ysql_minimal_catalog_caches_preload=true`\n\nStart connection 1:\n```\nCREATE TYPE user_color AS ENUM ('red', 'green', 'blue');\nCREATE TABLE user_enum_table (c user_color);\n```\n\nStart connection 2:\n```\nSET yb_neg_catcache_ids='23,24';\nINSERT INTO user_enum_table VALUES ('red');\n```\nThe `INSERT` fails with `ERROR:  invalid input value for enum user_color: \"red\"`.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-19288]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-19288?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/29485/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/29485/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}